    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36248" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντῑμ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>value in</i> or <i>among,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ταῖς μ́ μναῖς ἐνετιμᾶτο τὰ χρυσία
				καὶ τὰ ἱμάτια τῶν χιλίων [δραχμῶν</span>] <i><span class="en">
				D.
				41.27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὰς προῖκας ἐντετιμῆσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					48.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντετιμημένος</span>”
				<i>highly valued, valuable,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sophr.
					100
				</span></i>
			 codd. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντετμαμένα</span> Meineke):—
				Med.
			, <i>value</i> in giving a dowry, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				8.142
			</span></i>.</div>
